OL,3,GNEWSATram lines to close for two weeks
OL,4,Afor engineering work
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers in Greater Manchester have
OL,7,Fbeen warned no trams will run on three
OL,8,FMetrolink lines for two weeks from
OL,9,FMonday.
OL,11,FImprovement works will take place until
OL,12,F1 November at Deansgate-Castlefield and
OL,13,FTrafford Bar, as well as in Manchester
OL,14,Fcity centre.
OL,16,FNo trams will operate on the
OL,17,FAltrincham, Trafford Centre and Eccles
OL,18,Flines, while services operating on the
OL,19,FEast Didsbury/Manchester Airport lines
OL,20,Fwill terminate at Firswood. Tram
OL,21,Freplacement bus services will be in
OL,22,Foperation.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
